stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created
    Created --> Planned
    Planned --> Ready
    Ready --> Running
    Running --> Waiting: 等待资源或输入
    Waiting --> Ready: 条件满足
    Running --> Paused: 用户暂停或安全检查点
    Paused --> Ready: 恢复
    Running --> Verifying: 执行结束
    Verifying --> Succeeded: 证据通过
    Verifying --> Ready: 可修复且预算允许
    Running --> Unknown: 外部动作结果不明
    Unknown --> Verifying: 查询确认
    Unknown --> Waiting: 无法确认
    Running --> Failed: 不可恢复或预算耗尽
    Created --> Cancelled
    Ready --> Cancelled
    Paused --> Cancelled
    Running --> Cancelling: 请求取消
    Cancelling --> Cancelled: 到达可停止点
    Succeeded --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
